  m_text: Black raggedy dress from the 1920s, in worn wool and cotton blends. Loose-fitting,
    straight, mid-calf-length silhouette. Simple round neckline, slightly frayed
    at the edge. Drop-waist bodice, softly shaped and timeworn. Narrow sleeves, patched
    and uneven at the cuffs. Skirt plain and faded.
